- Fix a vulnerability reported by EntropyLab
  Bark kept the new VTXOs of a delegated round only in memory, and failed the
  round when the Ark server reported it as not found. A server could take the
  forfeits, withhold the unlock preimage and make bark forget the new VTXOs.
  Bark now stores the new VTXOs before it sends the forfeits, and does not fail
  a round that can have sent them.
  [#2810](https://gitlab.com/ark-bitcoin/bark/-/merge_requests/2810)
  - **BREAKING:** `RoundState::sync` is now private. Use `StoredRoundState::sync`.
